# Suggestion box and other clone-local APG state (adopted letter 0002): in source-worktree
# mode the materializer's inner `local/` exclusion never runs, so the source repository
# ignores the same path itself. Only clone-local state lives here — no distributed file does.
.agent-project-guides/local/

# AgentTeams runtime state (team file, tasks, mailboxes) is per-machine runtime, not source.
.agent-teams/
